#: ../../../Instrumentor.md:96
msgid ""
"**Alloca replacement**: The runtime can provide a different allocation size "
"or replace the allocated address"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Instrumentor.md:97
msgid ""
"**Argument replacement**: The runtime can modify the arguments passed to a "
"function"
